version: 1.3.10
date-released: 2026-07-29
abstract: >
  HerbivoR is a desktop GUI for leaf herbivory quantification from photographs,
  combining BiRefNet + MobileSAM segmentation, UNET Shape contour reconstruction,
  and a damage U-Net with interactive editing tools.
keywords:
  - herbivory
  - leaf damage
  - computer vision
  - deep learning
  - plant ecology
